text:
This looks like scrambled egg whites, or possibly crumbled cheese or tofu. The pale white, glossy chunks look most like cooked egg whites. The plate is about 25 cm across and the pile is small, so I estimate roughly 70 g. Cooked egg white is about 50 kcal per 100 g, which gives about 35 kcal.

If it were feta, 70 g would be about 185 kcal. The texture looks more like egg white, so I'll go with that.

